  "practice": [
    "Say খ three times with an extra puff of air: khô, khô, khô.",
    "Practice the vowel forms: খ (khô), খা (kha), খি (khi), খী (khi, uncommon), খু (khu), খূ (khu, rare), খে (khe), খৈ (khoi), খো (kho), and খৌ (khou, uncommon).",
    "Read the combinations aloud: খ + া = খা as in খাবার, খ + ি = খি as in খিদে, খ + ু = খু as in খুশি, খ + ে = খে as in খেলা, and খ + ো = খো as in খোলা.",
    "Put your hand near your mouth and compare ক (k, less air) with খ (kh, a noticeable puff): কাল / খাল, কাজ / খাবার, and কম / খেলা.",
    "Practice the essential খাওয়া family: খাওয়া, খাই, খাও, খাব, খাবে, খেতে, খেয়ে, and খেয়েছ.",
    "Use খুব, খাবার, খাওয়া, খুশি, খবর, খারাপ, খেলা, খোলা, and খরচ as quick reading anchors.",
    "Recognize these phrases instantly: খুব ভালো, আমি খেতে চাই, আমার খিদে পেয়েছে, কী খবর, and দরজা খোলো."
  ],
  "notes": [
    "খ is a very common Bangla consonant named khô. It is the aspirated partner of ক and is pronounced with an extra puff of air.",
    "The vowel-sign forms include খ (khô), খা (kha), খি (khi), খী (khi), খু (khu), খূ (khu), খে (khe), খৈ (khoi), খো (kho), and খৌ (khou). Examples include খবর, খাবার, খিদে, খুশি, খেলা, খৈ, and খোলা.",
    "Compare কাল (kal, tomorrow/yesterday), কাজ (kaj, work), and কম (kom, less) with খাল (khal, canal), খাবার (khabar, food), and খেলা (khela, game/play).",
    "Best words to memorize include খুব, খাবার, খাওয়া, খাই, খাব, খেতে, খেয়ে, খিদে, খুশি, খবর, খারাপ, খাতা, খেলা, খেলনা, খোঁজা, খুঁজে, খোলা, খোলো, খরচ, and খেয়াল."
